        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have a comprehensive suite of current program offerings, all of which are not currently offered in each campus in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 16797,
        "end_character": 16944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009479-59ca2056d1e5afc6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009479",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we emphasize science, technology, engineering and math (STEM) and business disciplines, areas in which we believe that there is large and growing demand, especially in developing countries.",
        "start_character": 1308,
        "end_character": 1512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009479",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009479-59ca2056d1e5afc6",
